invalid type: string "Depth First Variations\n \n  \n32\n\u{f07d}Depth First Search can also be implemented with recursive approach. And depending upon \nthe order in which we go in depth can bring different variations in order of node traversal. \nWhich are:\n\u{f07d}Pre-Order (simple DFS)\n1.\nVisit node\n2.\nVisit left child of node\n3.\nVisit right child of node\n\u{f07d}Post-Order\n1.\nected 